"person","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou","book_id":"b-shiji-009","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-009-lvhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p019","text":"三年十月丁酉晦，日有食之。十一月，上曰：「前日（計）［詔］遣列侯之國，或辭未行。丞相朕之所重，其為朕率列侯之國。」絳侯勃免丞相就國，以太尉潁陰侯嬰為丞相。罷太尉官，屬丞相。四月，城陽王章薨。淮南王長與從者魏敬殺辟陽侯審食其。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m019-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m019-0057","start":57,"end":60,"surface":"絳侯勃","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m019-0069","start":69,"end":73,"surface":"潁陰侯嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"sj9_pfu_fwh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m019-0089","start":89,"end":93,"surface":"城陽王章","kind":"person","person_id":"vfv_a3d_lsq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m019-0095","start":95,"end":99,"surface":"淮南王長","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m019-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"魏敬","kind":"person","person_id":"xpc_di7_68r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m019-0108","start":108,"end":111,"surface":"審食其","kind":"person","person_id":"qg7_n12_fne","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p020","text":"陵之免丞相，呂太后乃徙平爲右丞相，以辟陽侯審食其爲左丞相。左丞相不治，常給事於中。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m020-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"78k_der_mz8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m020-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"呂太后","kind":"person","person_id":"ky4_4k8_gjt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m020-0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"04f_hzf_n06","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m020-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"審食其","kind":"person","person_id":"2uk_lgn_scq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m020-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"左丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"2uk_lgn_scq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m020-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"左丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"2uk_lgn_scq","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","book_id":"b-shiji-056","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p021","text":"食其亦沛人。漢王之敗彭城西，楚取太上皇、呂后爲質，食其以舍人侍呂后。其後從破項籍爲侯，幸於呂太后。及爲相，居中，百官皆因決事。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m021-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"食其","kind":"person","person_id":"2uk_lgn_scq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m021-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"gcp_v0l_0vh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m021-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"太上皇","kind":"person","person_id":"b8p_yf7_87f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m021-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"ky4_4k8_gjt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m021-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"食其","kind":"person","person_id":"2uk_lgn_scq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m021-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"舍人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、泛稱官職、氏族或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m021-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"ky4_4k8_gjt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"i